##############################
## Stock analysis (local optimizers) — large price cache + generated reports.
## These live at the repo root and are read/written by the com.stock.analyzer
## optimizer main classes when run locally; they must never be committed
## (the price cache alone is ~428MB).
##############################
/strategies/
/sector_all_phases/
/sector_detail_report/
/sector_portfolio_compare/
/sector_csv/
/sector_csv_oos/
/sector_results_final/
/factor_research/
/framework_runs/

# ...but the winners snapshots bundled as classpath resources ARE required by the
# deployed Lambda scanner, so force-track them despite the global *.csv ignore.
!src/main/resources/stock/*.csv
